- Get blessing from Priest  | [if {catalytic_found_church} == false] [else="hide"]
	You feel yourself getting luckier
	if {is_catholic} == false:
		Would you like to convert to Catholicism?
		- Yes
			You accept Jesus Christ as your Lord and Savior. You have been saved!
			The priest is so happy that he was able to convert an alien to Catholicism, he gifts you a spare catalytic converter he had lying around!
			set {is_catholic} = true
			do Inventory.add_item("Catalytic_Converter")
			set {catalytic_found_church} = true
			do Global.use_action()
			set {Global.catholic} = true
		- No
			The priest glances at you disgustingly. “Leave this house of God immediately!
- Ask for Shelter
	if {is_catholic} == false:
		You need to have converted to Catholicism
	else:
		You stay the night at the church
		Would you like to spend a bullet to make it safer?
		- Yes
			if {Inventory.has_item("Gun")} and {Inventory.has_item("Bullet")}:
				do Inventory.remove_item("Bullet")
				set {random_chance} = range(1,100).pick_random()
				if {random_chance} <= 90:
					You slept safely
					do Global.sleep()
				else:
					Despite being on guard, you wake up feeling cursed
					do Global.sleep()
			else:
				You don't have the resources to do that
				set {random_chance} = range(1,100).pick_random()
				if {random_chance} <= 60:
					You slept safely
					do Global.sleep()
				else:
					You wake up feeling cursed
					do Global.sleep()
		- No
			set {random_chance} = range(1,100).pick_random()
			if {random_chance} <= 60:
				You slept safely
				do Global.sleep()
			else:
				You wake up feeling cursed
				do Global.sleep()